<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" name="viewport"/>
<title>Analysis Grids — BTS BUT &amp; Master's</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
<style>
:root {
  box-sizing: border-box;
  padding-top: env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px);
  padding-bottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px);
  --bg: #f5f6f8;
  --surface: #ffffff;
  --text: #1a1a2e;
  --muted: #6b7280;
  --border: #dfe2e8;
  --s1: #dc3545;
  --s1-bg: #fef2f2;
  --s1-border: #f5c6cb;
  --s3: #16a34a;
  --s3-bg: #f0fdf4;
  --s3-border: #86efac;
  --tab-active: #1e40af;
  --tab-bg: #e8ecf3;
  --hint-bg: #eef2ff;
  --hint-border: #818cf8;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  :root:not([data-theme="light"]) {
    --bg: #0c0e14; --surface: #161923; --text: #e4e5ea; --muted: #9ca3af;
    --border: #282d3a; --s1-bg: #1f1214; --s1-border: #5c2027;
   --s3-bg: #0c1f14; --s3-border: #1a5c34;
    --tab-active: #60a5fa; --tab-bg: #1e2333;
    --hint-bg: #1a1f33; --hint-border: #6366f1;
  }
}
:root[data-theme="dark"] {
  --bg: #0c0e14; --surface: #161923; --text: #e4e5ea; --muted: #9ca3af;
  --border: #282d3a; --s1-bg: #1f1214; --s1-border: #5c2027;
 --s3-bg: #0c1f14; --s3-border: #1a5c34;
  --tab-active: #60a5fa; --tab-bg: #1e2333;
  --hint-bg: #1a1f33; --hint-border: #6366f1;
}
* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
html { scroll-padding-top: env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px); }
body { font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); line-height: 1.6; }

.page { max-width: 1140px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem 1.25rem; }
h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: .3rem; }
.subtitle { color: var(--muted); font-size: .9rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }

/* Tabs */
.tabs { display: flex; gap: .5rem; margin-bottom: 1.75rem; }
.tab-btn {
  padding: .55rem 1.4rem; border-radius: 8px; border: none;
  font-family: inherit; font-size: .85rem; font-weight: 600;
  cursor: pointer; background: var(--tab-bg); color: var(--muted);
  transition: all .2s;
}
.tab-btn.active { background: var(--tab-active); color: #fff; }
.tab-content { display: none; }
.tab-content.active { display: block; }

/* Context box */
.context-box {
  background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.1rem 1.4rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  font-size: .88rem;
}
.context-box strong { font-weight: 700; }

/* Level badge */
.level-badge {
  display: inline-block; font-size: .68rem; font-weight: 700;
  padding: .2rem .6rem; border-radius: 5px; margin-bottom: 1rem;
  text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .04em;
}
.level-bts { background: #dbeafe; color: #1e40af; }
.level-mastere { background: #ede9fe; color: #5b21b6; }

/* Table */
.g-table {
  width: 100%; border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 0;
  font-size: .82rem; background: var(--surface);
  border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--border);
  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
}
.g-table thead th {
  padding: .7rem .9rem; font-weight: 700; font-size: .75rem;
  text-align: left; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border); background: var(--bg);
}
.g-table thead th:first-child { width: 22%; }
.g-table thead th.h1 { color: var(--tab-active); }
.g-table thead th.h2 { color: var(--s2); }
.g-table thead th.h3 { color: var(--s3); }
.g-table tbody td {
  padding: .65rem .9rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); vertical-align: top;
}
.g-table tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
.g-table tbody td:first-child { font-weight: 600; font-size: .78rem; color: var(--muted); }
.g-table tbody td:nth-child(2) { background: var(--hint-bg); }

.g-table tbody td:nth-child(3) { background: var(--hint-bg); }
.g-table .verdict-row td { font-weight: 700; }
.g-table .verdict-row td { height: 3rem; }

.tag {
  display: inline-block; font-size: .65rem; font-weight: 700;
  padding: .12rem .45rem; border-radius: 4px; margin-bottom: .25rem;
}
.tag-fail { background: var(--s1); color: #fff; }
.tag-win { background: var(--s3); color: #fff; }

/* Hint boxes */
.hint-box {
  background: var(--hint-bg); border-left: 3px solid var(--hint-border);
  border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; padding: .6rem .9rem; margin-bottom: .4rem;
  font-size: .8rem; color: var(--text);
}
.hint-box strong { font-weight: 600; }
.hint-label {
  font-size: .65rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--hint-border);
  text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .04em; margin-bottom: .15rem;
}

/* Questions */
.q-section {
  background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.2rem 1.4rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
}
.q-section h2 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: .8rem; }
.q-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: .65rem; }
@media (max-width: 700px) { .q-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
.q-item {
  padding: .6rem .8rem; border-radius: 6px;
  background: var(--bg); font-size: .83rem; position: relative;
}
.q-item strong { font-weight: 600; }
.q-item .q-hint {
  margin-top: .35rem; font-size: .75rem; color: var(--hint-border);
  font-style: italic;
}

.footer { text-align: center; color: var(--muted); font-size: .72rem; margin-top: 2rem; }

@media (max-width: 700px) {
  .g-table { font-size: .74rem; }
  .g-table thead th, .g-table tbody td { padding: .45rem .5rem; }
  h1 { font-size: 1.25rem; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
<h1>Analysis Grids — 2 CRM Negotiation Scenarios</h1>
<p class="subtitle">Célia (CRM sales rep) × Arhan (SME Sales Director) — Compare the two negotiation approaches</p>
<div class="tabs">
<button class="tab-btn active" onclick="switchTab('bts')">BTS / BUT</button>
<button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab('mastere')">Master's</button>
</div>
<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
