  <br/><strong>Instructions:</strong> Analyse each scenario against 9 criteria. The hints steer your thinking — the full analysis is yours.
</div>
<div style="overflow-x:auto;">
<table class="g-table">
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Criterion</th>
