</thead>
<tbody>
<!-- 1 -->
<tr>
<td>1. Overall approach</td>
<td>
<div class="hint-label">Hint</div>
<div class="hint-box">How many concessions does Célia grant? In what order? Who is leading the negotiation?</div>
</td>
<td>
<div class="hint-label">Hint</div>
<div class="hint-box">Célia quantifies the ROI before talking price. How does this change the dynamics of the negotiation?</div>
</td>
</tr>
<!-- 2 -->
<tr>
<td>2. Quality of discovery</td>
<td>
<div class="hint-label">Hint</div>
<div class="hint-box">Célia restates the needs already identified, but does she explore them further?</div>
</td>
<td>
<div class="hint-label">Hint</div>
