</td>
</tr>
<!-- 3 -->
<tr>
<td>3. Handling the price objection</td>
<td>
<div class="hint-label">Hint</div>
<div class="hint-box">2-year contract + preferential rate + 5% discount. How many margin levers does Célia use up?</div>
</td>
<td>
<div class="hint-label">Hint</div>
