</tr>
<!-- 5 -->
<tr>
<td>5. Negotiation stance</td>
<td><div class="hint-box">Accommodating or proactive?</div></td>
<td><div class="hint-box">Accommodating or proactive?</div></td>
</tr>
<!-- 6 -->
<tr>
<td>6. Margin protection</td>
<td>
<div class="hint-label">Hint</div>
<div class="hint-box">Triple concession without resistance. Estimate the total % of margin eroded (volume + rate + 5%).</div>
</td>
<td>
<div class="hint-label">Hint</div>
<div class="hint-box">12% discount BUT a 3-year commitment. Calculate the revenue secured over 3 years vs the cost of the discount. Who gains the most?</div>
</td>
</tr>
<!-- 7 -->
<tr>
<td>7. Length of commitment</td>
<td>
<div class="hint-label">Hint</div>
